itle":"Ultralife shares surge on EnerSys deal as earnings drive premarket movers","src":"Traders Union","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPc2FFYlRLNmJGUDUwbllkaG5nN0sxX2xjMWFXXzU5SXI0V1VpOHdYZUg4aWJTN2ppR3VhYXpILXUzWTFaakVDZG4wMDBLZS1TcmE3VEVGd09FSjBOVmktN1VHXzQwOUktUkNuYmZOX1A3Y3FNTkhWWDlidFRVbDBCVHlLOWk4bjFCX0huTjdzeVM3bzV5?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"由於盈利推動盤前走勢，Ultralife 股價因 EnerSys 交易而飆升"},{"title":"PPG Industries (PPG) Tops Q3 EPS by 12c ; Offers Guidance","src":"StreetInsider","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNbHY3eGhOX0ZTYXVkZFI4WGhfZXlMSnB0SUV5YjZjelc0OUR5eXh4Y0Y1WFY5VGdsUzB1ZUFRak16X3hveDBkWUxMem9mNVdudFdDNFZZUjU3eklLUUlBbDgyVkhySTFiQ1lvOW9VemdocXJ4ZnVLRnBraHVfZnI1RHY4Y2hxNTNTdG9Zb0NSNG5ZMEFwamNqdm9CWXdkc2J1WWEzRVRyLXYxUFRYaDRZZTBaS1Q2Nzg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"PPG 工業 (PPG) 第三季 EPS 成長 12c；優惠指導"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":10},{"name":"分析師評等","count":6},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/79879/000007987926000046/ppg-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"PPG Industries, Inc. manufactures and distributes a broad range of paints, coatings and specialty products. PPG was incorporated in Pennsylvania in 1883. PPG's vision is to be the first-choice partner to meet our customers' evolving needs for innovative paints, coatings and surface solutions to protect and beautify the world.","zh":"PPG Industries, Inc. 生產和分銷各種油漆、塗料和特殊產品。 PPG 於 1883 年在賓夕法尼亞州成立。 PPG 的願景是成為首選合作夥伴，滿足客戶對創新油漆、塗料和表面解決方案不斷變化的需求，從而保護和美化世界。"},{"en":"PPG has a proud heritage with a demonstrated commitment to innovation, sustainability, community engagement and development of leading-edge paint, coatings and specialty products. Through dedication and industry-leading expertise, we solve our customers' biggest challenges, collaborating closely to find the right path forward. PPG is a global leader that markets and sells in more than 50 countries.","zh":"PPG 擁有令人自豪的傳統，對創新、永續發展、社區參與以及尖端油漆、塗料和特殊產品的開發做出了堅定的承諾。透過奉獻精神和行業領先的專業知識，我們解決客戶面臨的最大挑戰，密切合作，找到正確的前進道路。 PPG 是全球領先企業，在 50 多個國家/地區進行行銷和銷售。"},{"en":"PPG supplies paints, coatings and specialty products to customers serving a wide array of end-uses, including industrial equipment and components; packaging material; aircraft and marine equipment; automotive original equipment; automotive refinish and aftermarket; pavement marking products; as well as coatings for other industrial and consumer products. PPG also serves commercial and residential new build and maintenance customers by supplying coatings to painting and maintenance contractors and directly to consumers for decoration and maintenance.","zh":"PPG 向客戶提供油漆、塗料和特殊產品，服務於各種最終用途，包括工業設備和零件；包裝材料；飛機和船舶設備；汽車原廠設備；汽車修補漆和售後市場；路面標記產品；以及其他工業和消費品的塗料。 PPG 也為商業和住宅新建及維護客戶提供服務，向油漆和維護承包商提供塗料，並直接向消費者提供裝飾和維護服務。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"environmental impacts. Our products contribute to lighter, more fuel-efficient vehicles, airplanes and ships, and they help our customers reduce their energy consumption, conserve water and reduce waste. These products include compact automotive paint processes and low temperature cure capabilities that save energy and reduce water usage at customer manufacturing sites; sustainably-advantaged waterborne coatings formulations; sustainably-advantaged powder coatings; lightweight sealants and coatings for aircraft; coatings that cool surfaces; coatings for recyclable metal packaging; antimicrobial products; coatings that contain reduced materials of concern; architectural coatings that contain lower carbon content raw materials; and solutions for autonomous and battery-powered vehicles. For the year ended December 31, 2025, 43% of sales were from sustainably-advantaged products and processe","zh":"環境影響。我們的產品有助於製造更輕、更省油的車輛、飛機和船舶，並幫助我們的客戶減少能源消耗、節約用水和減少浪費。這些產品包括緊湊的汽車油漆工藝和低溫固化功能，可節省能源並減少客戶製造現場的用水量；具有可持續優勢的水性塗料配方；具有可持續發展優勢的粉末塗料；飛機用輕質密封劑和塗料；冷卻表面的塗層；可回收金屬包裝塗料；抗菌產品；含有減少關注物質的材料塗料；含有較低碳材料含量較低的材料供應器的原始電池塗料和電池供應方案。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度，43% 的銷售額來自永續優勢產品和流程"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Industrial Coatings","val":6524000000,"zh":"工業塗料"},{"name":"Performance Coatings","val":5513000000,"zh":"高性能塗料"},{"name":"Global Architectural Coatings","val":3838000000,"zh":"全球建築塗料"}],"total":15875000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":5372000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":5368000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":2937000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Latin America","val":2198000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"}],"total":15875000000}},"peers":["SHW","APD","SWK","DOV","GWW"]}}